  <item>
    <title>i人上综艺，脚趾抠满地，小聊爆款音综.</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6592cc90bf3589e89486d3a3</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6592cc90bf3589e89486d3a3</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 2024 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>简介：</span></p><span></span><p><span>无可否认，《声生不息》是近几年音综节目中的标杆了，经历了“港乐季”“宝岛季”之后，这一季“家年华”系列，想要讲述的不仅仅是音乐，更是音乐背后关于中华大地上每一段值得歌颂的故事。</span></p><span></span><p><span>当然，看音综，每个人的喜好都不一样。你更喜欢看舞台演绎部分，还是真人秀部分？歌手们的除了有超棒的舞台之外，私下的状态如何？哪些歌手的陈年老瓜被主播翻出？i人歌手在初识舞台的时候真的是脚趾抠地？面对初舞台的呈现，哪些让你惊艳，哪些有略带失望？</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期《瓜儿与少年》，添乐、可乐和丝丝一起和大家聊聊《声生不息家年华》爆款音综观后感，歌手们的舞台演绎哪些让你惊掉下巴？本期是无影瓜，边听边捕捉才能吃下！</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间轴：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="195">03:15</a> &nbsp;王安宇的穿搭是可乐的菜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="335">05:35</a> &nbsp;一首歌，带回到电视剧OST童年记忆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="516">08:36</a> &nbsp;年轻时的毛毛姐“情窦初开”？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="733">12:13</a> &nbsp;周深的i人体质</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="941">15:41</a> &nbsp;舞台舞美像“迪奥”口红盖子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1288">21:28</a> &nbsp;TA每天都要换床单</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1564">26:04</a> &nbsp;李雪琴其实是个瘦子？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1635">27:15</a> &nbsp;录节目到凌晨3点后，早上被“退房”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1725">28:45</a> &nbsp;孙楠重回芒果的“爷青回”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2121">35:21</a> &nbsp;艺人的年龄槛：王心凌身上的闪光点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2201">36:41</a> &nbsp;黄绮珊的健身减肥经</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2523">42:03</a> &nbsp;什么综艺让可乐改变对林心如的印象？</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lonbaUfGrvObaxCjoaLa-X0dBxvW.m4a" length="43382801" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:44:39</itunes:duration>
