    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>在游泳池更衣室与0713老友“坦诚相见”？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/657d8239cab6086ec1edffc9</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">657d8239cab6086ec1edffc9</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 17 Dec 2023 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>简介：</span></p><span></span><p><span>自从“再就业男团”回归大众视野，演艺事业也有了质的改变，大家过去一年接的“碎活”越来越多，《我们的歌》《披荆斩棘》等热门IP也有了他们的身影。芒果更是趁热打铁，专门为6位好兄弟定制了一档全年“朋综”——《快乐老友记》。</span></p><span></span><p><span>没错，他们有了“班儿”上！“至少今天很快乐”，主打的就是一个随心所欲。不管你是老粉还是新粉，你都可以在0713这里拿走你想要的全部快乐。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期《瓜儿与少年》，我们邀请到陆虎的同班同学，主持人“小哈”做客节目，一起聊聊他眼中的陆虎，和看《快乐老友记》之后的感受。0713哪位曾在低谷中徘徊？在泳池与哪位“坦诚相见”？身为陆虎的同学，小哈粉了张远多年，原因竟让是……为何TA能成为出淤泥而不染的“白莲花”？本期是多年同学瓜，下巴笑到脱臼也要吃下！</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间轴：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="158">02:38</a> &nbsp;录节目前与陆虎发微信</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="462">07:42</a> &nbsp;0713男团共同经历低谷</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="673">11:13</a> &nbsp;与XXX在游泳池更衣室“坦诚相待”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="848">14:08</a> &nbsp;广电周边偶遇明星机会升级</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1075">17:55</a> &nbsp;陆虎多年的同学，居然是张远的“颜粉”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1175">19:35</a> &nbsp;快乐男声时代的陆虎</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1463">24:23</a> &nbsp;苏醒受到一万点伤害……</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1673">27:53</a> &nbsp;至上励合里的“白莲花”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1830">30:30</a> &nbsp;“婚礼歌手”意难平？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2086">34:46</a> &nbsp;魏晨不需要“再就业”，一直有活儿</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2475">41:15</a> &nbsp;QQ空间存留的陆虎学生时期合照</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2540">42:20</a> &nbsp;多年同学认真聊陆虎的创作</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2871">47:51</a> &nbsp;那些消失的快男快女</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lvato_lFUvOqCqZ8IDCjES9AU0yA.m4a" length="49222078" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:50:40</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fl-k55py0k72OU5qyQlOPaiVT0u3.jpg"/>
