  <item>
    <title>爆料总要&quot;周一见&quot;？八卦号背后的生意和金主</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63ee464051a4e4150a9f19bc</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">63ee464051a4e4150a9f19bc</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 16 Feb 2023 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>简介：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>娱乐圈爆料究竟来自于哪里？正主亲自下场拆CP？那些因剧爆火的CP有真的吗？哪些艺人又是绝对的干净呢？资深狗仔告诉你圈内你不知道的问题……</span></p><span></span><p><span>八卦营销号，最初通过分享娱乐明星资讯和作品资讯收获了一批关注度。早期的八卦营销号主要以分享安利为主，而且他们针对一些娱乐事件的点评也很有想法。随后,“饭圈”的专业化和娱乐圈的关注度加速了八卦营销号的职业化，八卦营销号的数量陡然增多，竞争激烈，他们不得不另辟蹊径以走歪门邪道获得流量。</span></p><span></span><p><span>“拿钱办事”是业内对八卦营销号的共识，但事实上却并不如此。娱乐圈的水有多深？娱乐号的营销收入“有需求就会有市场”，只要平台还在，八卦营销号就仍有生存土壤。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期《瓜儿与少年》，承接上一期节目我们邀请到“中国第一狗仔”合伙人老王，和大家继续聊聊八卦娱乐号的发展。那些年的大瓜事实真相果真如此吗？为了爆料狗仔究竟要冒多大的风险？最后再八卦一下有趣的料，本期是CP瓜，更多精彩等你来开！</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间轴：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="78">01:18</a>大家的吃瓜来源</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="270">04:30</a>八卦号信息收集速度</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="310">05:10</a>八卦号之间的区别</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="335">05:35</a>爆料来自于哪些方向?</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="465">07:45</a>为了脱离捆绑找狗仔</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="578">09:38</a>陈x与毛xx事件为何如此详细?</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="714">11:54</a>有详细时间线的事件一定有预谋</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="775">12:55</a>娱乐圈恋爱结局为什么一定要撕？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="843">14:03</a>毛x前任分手后被“制裁”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="903">15:03</a>出圈的爆料号有多少？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1050">17:30</a>什么算八卦营销号</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1110">18:30</a>关于爆料预告</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1200">20:00</a>爆料号怎么赚钱？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1365">22:45</a>跟拍明星的成本</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1430">23:50</a>明星买瓜买不干净</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1495">24:55</a>爆料存在被告过的现象？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1570">26:10</a>发律师函究竟为了什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1625">27:05</a>剧抛CP营业</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1690">28:10</a>对某一艺人一边骂一边夸的现象</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1750">29:10</a>狗仔会因为剧CP而跟拍吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1795">29:55</a>剧CP有真的吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1800">30:00</a>哪些艺人绝对没有料？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1930">32:10</a>明星亲自找上门要求爆料发好看的照片</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2020">33:40</a>快扛不住的明星有谁？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2170">36:10</a>关注艺人作品</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2235">37:15</a>营销号小编有必要投身吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2380">39:40</a>营销号之间的鄙视链</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lh15-sFV5PVKzt6wvkdmGiMTDMhC.m4a" length="76717478" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:39:43</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fl-k55py0k72OU5qyQlOPaiVT0u3.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>对话内娱资深狗仔：圈内猛料是这样诞生的</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63e5182d51a4e4150a1b738f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">63e5182d51a4e4150a1b738f</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 09 Feb 2023 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>简介：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>娱乐圈那些惊世骇俗的大瓜是怎么被狗仔拍到的？当狗仔要面临多少风险和挑战？狗仔行业真的没落了嘛？资深狗仔这里的瓜好香……</span></p><span></span><p><span>上世纪90年代，香港娱乐产业发达，狗仔文化传入港台，那时很多香港娱乐记者利用调查追踪的方式长期蹲守明星艺人，挖掘猛料，报道了不少香港娱乐圈惊世骇俗的消息。狗仔不仅成为年轻人的就业选择，因为常年接触富豪明星，甚至成了他们阶层晋升的渠道。</span></p><span></span><p><span>2002年后内娱狗仔行业开始萌芽，娱乐报道铺天盖地充斥着人们的眼球，从报纸杂志的头版头条，到“中国第一狗仔”这样的狗仔团队及工作室，内地狗仔越来越职业，也越来越大胆，出轨负面，吸毒嫖娼……那些活在鲜亮外壳包裹下的艺人们被狗仔揭开面具……</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期《瓜儿与少年》，我们邀请到“中国第一狗仔”合伙人老王，和大家聊聊娱乐圈“狗仔”的发展轨迹。当年的那些大瓜猛料是怎么被拍到的？为了跟拍一个明星，狗仔到底有多拼？狗仔与代拍、站姐到底有什么区别？狗仔行业的底线到底在哪里？本期是陈年香瓜，配一杯二锅头下肚吧……</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间轴：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="160">02:40</a> &nbsp;与中国第一狗仔团队合作十五六年</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="190">03:10</a> &nbsp;狗仔最早的兴起</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="258">04:18</a> &nbsp;标题党到底有没有下限？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="478">07:58</a> &nbsp;那些自爆恋情绯闻的明星</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="610">10:10</a> &nbsp;白XX女儿被绑票，跪求媒体不要跟踪报道</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="708">11:48</a> &nbsp;狗仔职业的工资体系</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="764">12:44</a> &nbsp;陈XX得罪某家媒体，最后道歉！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="816">13:36</a> &nbsp;内地的狗仔生态</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="855">14:15</a> &nbsp;小X娜直播分享与顶流男的爱情故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="843">14:03</a> &nbsp;近日胡X被狗仔蹲守</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="961">16:01</a> &nbsp;文章姚笛当年是怎么被拍到的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="992">16:32</a> &nbsp;狗仔的狗仔运</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1052">17:32</a> &nbsp;狗仔的资源来源于哪里</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1124">18:44</a> &nbsp;狗仔跟拍明星到底有多拼</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1151">19:11</a> &nbsp;明星遭遇狗仔，报警！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1273">21:13</a> &nbsp;狗仔所面临的风险有多大？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1520">25:20</a> &nbsp;狗仔跟一个明星要花费多大人力和物力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1605">26:45</a> &nbsp;狗仔爬上房屋烟囱拍明星</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1684">28:04</a> &nbsp;代拍的各种事儿</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1840">30:40</a> &nbsp;内地狗仔行业从业人员基数</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1978">32:58</a> &nbsp;朝阳群众变身为“狗仔”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2000">33:20</a> &nbsp;狗仔行业没落了吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2142">35:42</a> &nbsp;陈冠希、鹿晗呛声狗仔名场面！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2299">38:19</a> &nbsp;狗仔未来的发展方向</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2388">39:48</a> &nbsp;明星与狗仔的微妙关系，明星需要狗仔？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2515">41:55</a> &nbsp;人性化解读狗仔和八卦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2634">43:54</a> &nbsp;狗仔的报道底线</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lth6P8nmhk4pygCRJ3BPCugUmLd0.m4a" length="44826563" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:46:09</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fl-k55py0k72OU5qyQlOPaiVT0u3.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>就这？待爆艺人还想“洗牌”内娱？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63daaf0851a4e4150a971b4d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">63daaf0851a4e4150a971b4d</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 01 Feb 2023 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>简介：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>新生代们要“洗牌”内娱？2023待爆艺人中，有你看好的吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>娱乐圈代际更迭飞速，小花小生的出现让人目不暇接，谁是备受瞩目的“新贵”？谁是转眼过气的“老人”？谁能顺利拿过交接棒？狐厂娱乐观察统计了30位媒体眼中的2023待爆项目，总结了媒体期待值最高的待播剧，及媒体眼中的8位待爆演员（男女各4位）。当然，即便是其中待爆呼声最高的人气选手，也会有媒体不看好。他们列出了影响飞升的不确定因素，包括演技不稳定、恋情有影响、营业不频繁、库存质量有待观察等。</span></p><span></span><p><span>2023，又一轮“待爆突围赛”即将拉开帷幕……</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期《瓜儿与少年》，我们继续邀请两位圈内明星经纪人小美和小帅（化名），一起聊聊这份2023待爆艺人名单，看看新生代们要“洗牌”内娱，还有多少路要走……本期是开年瓜，收下开门红赶紧吃吧！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>时间轴：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="146">02:26</a> 大家眼中的待爆新人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="210">03:30</a> 站姐vs经纪公司，他成为最大受害人？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="288">04:48</a> 张凌赫唱歌：唱得很好，下次不要再唱了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="401">06:41</a> 上一期节目vocal担当谜底大揭晓</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="504">08:24</a> 待爆艺人的评选标准</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="601">10:01</a> 待爆男艺人入围者中的颜值考验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="748">12:28</a> 待爆男艺人大部分来自古偶？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="805">13:25</a> 由王栎鑫的保养引发的明星医美话题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="916">15:16</a> 待爆女艺人名单中的众多槽点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="951">15:51</a> 待爆女艺人们的评价与展望</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1127">18:47</a> 蒋依依为什么只是待爆女艺人中的入围者</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1314">21:54</a> 哪些艺人比较“卷”？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1405">23:25</a> 待爆艺人的业务能力大讨论</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1439">23:59</a> 那些“资源”堆出来的艺人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1578">26:18</a> 公司会“抛弃”艺人？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1642">27:22</a> 不同的团队与公司带给艺人的资源</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>2023媒体眼中的待爆男女演员名单⇓⇓⇓</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FneymQ9Dh9hTIZ0GPFecyMoaQJ7p.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fh915iiyeDDBvuhJXYsKsI71KxKH.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
