  <item>
    <title>让录音师当场崩溃和“下跪”的爱豆</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63bef41deab1781ef439bf70</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">63bef41deab1781ef439bf70</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 11 Jan 2023 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>简介：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>真话很难听，但也很实在，唱跳拉胯的艺人还是有很多的……</span></p><span></span><p><span>一档综艺节目的后期制作，可能会由十几个团队共同完成，每个团队都是其中的一颗螺丝钉。录制画面中的奇葩操作你知道吗？艺人进棚录歌实力悬殊能有多大？idol团内vocal担当录歌，录音师“跪下”？不修音的音综还存在吗？后期眼中看到的你不知道的事，都在这期番外瓜当中来获取吧！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期《瓜儿与少年》，我们依然邀请到了后期制作公司杨老板，节目混音师编编，播客《听说了吗》制作人丝丝，还有媒体人/吃瓜爱好者伏伏，聊聊后期从业者在工作时看到的，听到的有趣的事。番外瓜，犀利又实在，挤片柠檬吃吧……</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>时间轴：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="104">01:44</a> &nbsp;综艺后期到底有多少环节</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="219">03:39</a> &nbsp;后期拿到画面素材：某大花在挖鼻孔</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="280">04:40</a> &nbsp;后期听到过的艺人拉胯唱功</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="368">06:08</a> &nbsp;idol录歌开口跪！录音师跪！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="459">07:39</a> &nbsp;综艺NPC微表情分析师——江湖骗子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="520">08:40</a> &nbsp;综艺录制中状态极好的艺人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="552">09:12</a> &nbsp;修音到底有多难？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="733">12:13</a> &nbsp;录音在综艺中的重要性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="774">12:54</a> &nbsp;吉克隽逸棚内录歌实力吊打</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="862">14:22</a> &nbsp;某女vocal担当录歌堪称“车祸现场”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1036">17:16</a> &nbsp;早年歌手硬靠唱功，不修音出道</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1161">19:21</a> &nbsp;不修音的音综还存在吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1266">21:06</a> &nbsp;反差巨大的后期内心OS</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1321">22:01</a> &nbsp;2023年对综艺的期待</span></p>]]></description>
